5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to be precise about the costs this year. I'll look into the transport receipts and the public bed rates.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to see who handled the work last time. I'll check the cooking duty and the public booking lottery process.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I'm concerned about the social atmosphere. I'll look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to ensure everyone actually rests. I'll check the accounts from clubs that went inland and the club's own hall timetable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I suspect the flat fee is unfair. I'll investigate the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the membership list against train times.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
