55,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option A is far, but having a single building makes the cost easier to track than fragmented campus beds.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is the only one that removes the cooking burden and the lottery stress.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A ensures we all stay together, which is the only way to fix the year-group divide.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option A provides the best environment for actual rest compared to eight people to a room.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A is the most expensive and risky, but B and C are functionally impossible.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll vote for A. It's the most stable choice if we set the fee correctly this time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I'm with Ryuji. A is the only sustainable choice for the organizers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minako,,I vote for A. The social health of the club depends on this.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for A. The quality of the training depends on the quality of the sleep.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will also vote for A, despite my concerns about the non-refundable deposits.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
